Approximate minimum degree ordering (src/chol/amd_*.c): the algorithm is that
of Amestoy, Davis and Duff (SIAM J. Matrix Anal. Appl. 17, 1996).  The
implementation follows the organisation of cs_amd in T. A. Davis, "Direct
Methods for Sparse Linear Systems" (SIAM, 2006), whose CSparse code is
licensed LGPL-2.1-or-later.  Check whether that matters for your intended
license before redistribution; SuiteSparse's separate AMD package is
BSD-3-Clause and could replace these files behind the same interface
(arc_amd_order in src/chol/graph.h).

Netlib test problems (data/, not part of this source tree) come from the
SuiteSparse Matrix Collection via the arcLP repository.
